menu "Secure Element Configuration"

    config SE_MOCK_MODE
        bool "Use mock secure element (DEV ONLY)"
        default n
        help
            Software simulation of ATECC608B for development.
            WARNING: Provides NO security. Never enable in production.

    config PRODUCTION_BUILD
        bool "Production build"
        default n
        help
            Enable production build mode. This enforces security
            requirements and disables development-only features.
            Mock secure element cannot be used with this enabled.

endmenu
